commit 097248fbe6bb60a345b2fefbd1a0eb925f214f00
Author: Konata <konata@KonatadeMacBook-Pro.local>
Date:   Thu Aug 27 12:13:32 2026 +0800

    refactor(fe,panels,ui,stores): split sidebar agent sessions and device-tree dialogs; fix sidebar-adjacent bugs
    
    - split sidebar-agent-sessions.tsx into controller hook, row and dialog
      components; group sessions by pane once; stable session ordering; list
      sessions whose pane vanished as orphans; proper menu aria-label; gate the
      provider on features.agentUi; single bootstrap via sessionsLoaded
    - nav-main renders NavLink through SidebarMenuButton render prop with
      router-derived active state (no nested <a><button>)
    - device tree: no agent action for pane-less windows, safe pane param
      decoding, devices query error state with retry, drag disabled while a
      reorder is pending, timer-based pending navigation expiry, dialogs split
      into hooks/components, shared window/pane action builders
    - agent tab: rebind only within the same device, resync draft to route on
      pane switch, keep devices loading/error out of the orphan check;
      files tab shows a roots error state with retry
    - sidebar collapse state is now controlled by the persisted ui store (Ctrl+B
      and programmatic open survive refresh), safe localStorage access, drop
      write-only cookie; newAgentSession shortcut opens the mobile sidebar
    - tmux store: clear connect dedupe on disconnect so an immediate reconnect
      re-sends connect-device
    
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y3oYTN2vgHrHcmXgStDSC5

